        "filter": "sys.set_lazy_imports_filter takes a callable receiving the importing\nmodule's name, the imported name, and the fromlist.  Return True to\nlet an import be lazy, False to force it eager -- so you can defer\nyour own package while keeping third-party imports eager.",
